OL,3,GNEWSA'Hope' as Black Friday ad ban     
OL,4,Alaunches in UK first                   
OL,6,FThe first city in the UK to ban        
OL,7,Fadvertisements for Black Friday and    
OL,8,Ffast fashion sales has sparked "hope"  
OL,9,Famong independent retailers.           
OL,11,FThe Green-run Bristol City Council     
OL,12,Fvoted in September to ban the          
OL,13,Fpromotions on council-owned billboards 
OL,14,Fas part of the authority's efforts to  
OL,15,Ffight climate change.                  
OL,17,FAhead of Black Friday, some independent
OL,18,Fbusinesses said the move could help    
OL,19,Ftheir trade, while a Gloucestershire   
OL,20,Fparent warned the annual mass sale is  
OL,21,Foften overplayed.                      
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
