OL,3,GNEWSA'Hope' as Black Friday ad ban     
OL,4,Alaunches in UK first                   
OL,6,FRushka Gray, who works at Bristol      
OL,7,FGloucester Road's independent UStudio, 
OL,8,Fsaid: "I think it's a really good      
OL,9,Fstart...it just gives independents     
OL,10,Fmaybe a little bit more of a head      
OL,11,Fstart. I hope that it makes a          
OL,12,Fdifference."                           
